# The Wandering Sorting Barge (CIPlay wandering_sorting_barge; a side island of The Last Post): quest "The Sorting Barge"
island The Wandering Sorting Barge
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Sorting Barge
expect hidden clerkthanks
zone barge_deck
expect step 1
read Barge clerk's log
expect step 2
open Barge strongbox
expect message locked
use scales
expect story bargeweighed 1
expect shown clerkthanks
expect step 3
open Barge strongbox
wait 3
expect item Battery 2
expect step 4
read Clerk's thanks
expect done
